| singleton | 0 | 0 | `[1]` |
| duplicates | 1 | 3 | `[2, 2, 2]` |
| near INT_MIN | 4 | 2 | `[-2147483648, -2147483645]` |
Full signed range rejected before dense allocation: true.
\image(figures/pigeonhole_sort_controls.svg)
